              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela daimona naakatandwa, syataambi wakaamba, Lino makamu akagamba, akati, Cintu cili boobo tacina kubonwa mu-Israyeli lyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
