        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jesu wakali kuya bweendeenda muminzi yoonse amutunzi toonse, kaya bwiisya muzikombelo zyabo akukambauka makani mabotu aa-Bwami, akuponya malwazi oonse amalengwa oonse. ",
